{"title": "Chest of the Mundane", "pageid": 6, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Chest_of_the_Mundane", "categories": ["Containers", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Jeweled_Chest_A_Faded.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Jeweled_Chest_A_Faded.webp/300px-Jeweled_Chest_A_Faded.webp, /w/images/5/5d/Jeweled_Chest_A_Faded.webp 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Chest of the Mundane image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Jeweled_Chest_A_Faded.webp/300px-Jeweled_Chest_A_Faded.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5d/Jeweled_Chest_A_Faded.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <b>Chest of the Mundane</b> is a gilded chest that makes items in it appear to be mundane objects.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Looking at this chest fills you with a suspiciously overwhelming feeling that there is absolutely nothing special about it.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Containers\" title=\"Containers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Containers_Icon.png/25px-Containers_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/Containers_Icon.png/38px-Containers_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c2/Containers_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Containers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Containers_Icon.png/25px-Containers_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c2/Containers_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Containers\" title=\"Containers\">Containers</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 100 kg (200 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 100 kg (200 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 1 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  1  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-37da6525bbc1ab5dEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-6d0126d97b42fbefEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_UND_ChestOfMundane</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_UND_ChestOfMundane\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_UND_ChestOfMundane\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">fd56efe0-fbd4-471d-9661-856f732a77ef</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:fd56efe0-fbd4-471d-9661-856f732a77ef\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:fd56efe0-fbd4-471d-9661-856f732a77ef\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On the northern balcony of the main floor (the one with the large main gate guarded by <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Turret\" title=\"Arcane Turret\">Arcane Turrets</a>) of the <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Tower\" title=\"Arcane Tower\">Arcane Tower</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a> region of <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\"> Usage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The chest contains: <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mystra%27s_Grace\" title=\"Mystra's Grace\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4a/Boots_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Boots_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4a/Boots_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Boots_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4a/Boots_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Boots_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4a/Boots_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Boots_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4a/Boots_Leather_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mystra%27s_Grace\" title=\"Mystra's Grace\">Mystra's Grace</a>, a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Mage_Armour\" title=\"Scroll of Mage Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Scroll_of_Mage_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Scroll_of_Mage_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Scroll_of_Mage_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Scroll_of_Mage_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Scroll_of_Mage_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Scroll_of_Mage_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Scroll_of_Mage_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Scroll_of_Mage_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Scroll_of_Mage_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Mage_Armour\" title=\"Scroll of Mage Armour\">Scroll of Mage Armour</a>, a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Protection_from_Evil_and_Good\" title=\"Scroll of Protection from Evil and Good\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Scroll_of_Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Scroll_of_Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Scroll_of_Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Scroll_of_Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Scroll_of_Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Scroll_of_Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Scroll_of_Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Scroll_of_Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Scroll_of_Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Protection_from_Evil_and_Good\" title=\"Scroll of Protection from Evil and Good\">Scroll of Protection from Evil and Good</a>, a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gold_Ingot\" title=\"Gold Ingot\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Gold_Ingot_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gold_Ingot_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Gold_Ingot_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gold_Ingot_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Gold_Ingot_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Gold_Ingot_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Gold_Ingot_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gold_Ingot_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c3/Gold_Ingot_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gold_Ingot\" title=\"Gold Ingot\">Gold Ingot</a> and a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hearthlight_Bomb\" title=\"Hearthlight Bomb\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/GRN_Hearthlight_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-GRN_Hearthlight_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/GRN_Hearthlight_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-GRN_Hearthlight_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/GRN_Hearthlight_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-GRN_Hearthlight_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/GRN_Hearthlight_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-GRN_Hearthlight_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5e/GRN_Hearthlight_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hearthlight_Bomb\" title=\"Hearthlight Bomb\">Hearthlight Bomb</a>.</li>\n<li>While appearing as a regular gilded chest, the Chest of the Mundane is actually a magical chest which makes any items stored in it appear to be completely mundane objects, such as a mug, ladle, plate, and so on. Its effects can be negated by the anti-magic aura of a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sussur_Bloom\" title=\"Sussur Bloom\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Sussur_Bloom_Item_Icon.png/20px-Sussur_Bloom_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Sussur_Bloom_Item_Icon.png/30px-Sussur_Bloom_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Sussur_Bloom_Item_Icon.png/40px-Sussur_Bloom_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Sussur_Bloom_Item_Icon.png/20px-Sussur_Bloom_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Sussur_Bloom_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sussur_Bloom\" title=\"Sussur Bloom\">Sussur Bloom</a>, or by simply by taking the items out of it.</li>\n<li>When first interacting with the chest by putting something in it or taking something out, the player character may remark that it is a \"Chest of Transformation\". Doing so grants the inspiration <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Guild_Artisan#Trash_&amp;_Treasure\" title=\"Guild Artisan\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/38px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/50px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Trash &amp; Treasure\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Guild_Artisan#Trash_&amp;_Treasure\" title=\"Guild Artisan\">Trash &amp; Treasure</a> for party members with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Guild_Artisan\" title=\"Guild Artisan\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png/20px-Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png/30px-Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png/40px-Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Guild Artisan\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png/20px-Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Guild_Artisan\" title=\"Guild Artisan\">Guild Artisan</a> background.</li>\n<li>The chest does not transform corpses.</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Though irrelevant to game mechanics, it is no longer clear in terms of lore whether the chest merely creates an illusion upon the appearance of items stored within, or temporarily transforms them into a different physical object. Specifically:\n<ul><li>With <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://baldursgate3.game/news/patch-1-now-live_87\">Patch 1 of 08/25/2023</a>, the chest was  modified: items stored in it no longer change their weight to fit that of plates, cups, and the like, and the weight of the chest itself was changed from 20 kg to 100 kg. Presumably, this was done to prevent the party from carrying this chest and using it to store items with greatly reduced amounts of weight.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Prior to <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://baldursgate3.game/news/patch-7-now-live_121\">Patch 7 of 09/05/2024</a>, the chest had a maximum worth capacity, which meant that if a party decided to put gold inside it, it would transform the gold into items worth only up to 21g total, meaning any excess was lost.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715003331\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.107 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.116 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4007/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 47018/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 15843/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.043/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1269787/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   96.906      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   96.906      1 -total\n 39.87%   38.632      6 Template:Item_icon\n 37.40%   36.240      5 Template:SmRarityItem\n 29.80%   28.875     52 Template:Trim\n 27.22%   26.380      7 Template:Icon_text\n 12.77%   12.380     12 Template:ItemIcon_Internal\n 12.62%   12.230     19 Template:Ifempty\n 11.38%   11.027      2 Template:Uid\n 10.67%   10.336     19 Template:Icon\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:6-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715003331 and revision id 320942. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}